@startuml Composite-Equipment
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title GoF Graphics Example \nAfter Composite

abstract class Equipment <<Iterable>> {
  - name : String
  + name() : String
  + {abstract} power() : int
  + {abstract} netPrice() : Currency
  + {abstract} discountPrice() : Currency
  + add(part : Equipment) : void
  + remove(part : Equipment) : void
  + iterator() : Iterator<Equipment>
  + isComposite() : boolean
}
note right of Equipment
  Component

  add / remove fail by default.
  iterator() yields nothing for
  a leaf, so one recursive walk
  handles every node.
end note

class FloppyDisk {
  - watts : int
  - listPrice : Currency
  + power() : int
  + netPrice() : Currency
  + discountPrice() : Currency
}

class Card {
  - watts : int
  - listPrice : Currency
  + power() : int
  + netPrice() : Currency
  + discountPrice() : Currency
}

note bottom of Card : Leaf (simple equipment)

abstract class CompositeEquipment {
  - equipment : List<Equipment>
  + power() : int
  + netPrice() : Currency
  + discountPrice() : Currency
  + add(part : Equipment) : void
  + remove(part : Equipment) : void
  + iterator() : Iterator<Equipment>
  # ownPower() : int
  # ownNetPrice() : Currency
  # ownDiscountRate() : double
}
note right of CompositeEquipment
  Composite

  netPrice() = ownNetPrice()
            + Σ child.netPrice()

  Subclasses override only the
  own... hooks, so the summing
  loop exists in one place.
end note

class Chassis {
  # ownPower() : int
  # ownNetPrice() : Currency
  # ownDiscountRate() : double
}

class Cabinet {
  # ownNetPrice() : Currency
  # ownDiscountRate() : double
}

class Bus {
  # ownPower() : int
  # ownNetPrice() : Currency
  # ownDiscountRate() : double
}

note bottom of Cabinet : Concrete composites\n(assemblies)

class Currency <<record>> {
  - amount : BigDecimal
  + plus(other : Currency) : Currency
  + times(factor : double) : Currency
}

class Demo
note top of Demo : Client

Demo --> Equipment
Equipment <|-- FloppyDisk
Equipment <|-- Card
Equipment <|-- CompositeEquipment
CompositeEquipment <|-- Chassis
CompositeEquipment <|-- Cabinet
CompositeEquipment <|-- Bus
CompositeEquipment o--> "equipment\n*" Equipment
Equipment ..> Currency

@enduml
